Hi <%= @first_name %>,

<% if @added_by %>
<%= @added_by.name.presence || @added_by.email %> added you as a volunteer at <%= @event.name %>.
<% else %>
You've been added as a volunteer at <%= @event.name %>.
<% end %>
<% if @badges.any? %>

Everyone working at a Hack Club event needs to complete our safeguarding training first. Before the event, please earn <%= @badges.map(&:name).to_sentence %> on Attend -- sign in with your Hack Club account using this email address (<%= @user.email %>):

<%= @training_url %>
<% end %>

<% if @added_by %>
Questions? Just reply to this email and it'll go to <%= @added_by.email %>.
<% else %>
Questions? Just reply to this email.
<% end %>
